    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35134" root="قتب" body-key="q">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَتْبٌ</span></b>  The <i>feeding</i> (O, K) a guest (O) <i>with</i>
[<i>the intestines called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْتَاب</span> [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِتْبٌ</span> or of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِتْبَةٌ</span>]
<i>roasted,</i> or <i>broiled:</i> (O, K:) an inf. n. of which
the verb is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَتَبَ</span>. (TK.)

